		"text":    "package draft\n\nproblem: \"The goal of cueverge is to be a semi-autonomous software factory with no bottleneck. Its entry point is objectives and constraints, which can express any kind of test to validate the state of the software.\"\n\nobjectives: {\n\tautonomy: {\n\t\tsays: \"The factory builds and changes software by itself, and a person only sets the objectives and constraints.\"\n\t\twhy:  \"The people who own a project should not have to review each step, so work keeps moving.\"\n\t}\n\tno_bottleneck: {\n\t\tsays: \"No single step, agent or person blocks the flow of work in the factory.\"\n\t\twhy:  \"A blocked step stops the whole factory, so throughput and delivery speed fall for every project.\"\n\t}\n\texpressive_tests: {\n\t\tsays: \"Objectives and constraints can express any kind of test that validates the state of the software.\"\n\t\twhy:  \"A person can only trust the factory if every property they care about can be checked by a machine.\"\n\t}\n}\n\nconstraints: {\n\tevery_rule_is_cue: {\n\t\tsays:    \"Every rule of judgement is written in CUE, and the kernel holds no rule.\"\n\t\tmeasure: \"Run cue vet -c ./... in cueverge and in tool/cue, and it must exit with code 0.\"\n\t\tserves: [\"expressive_tests\", \"autonomy\"]\n\t}\n\tevery_check_is_runnable: {\n\t\tsays:    \"Every constraint carries a measure that a machine can run without a person.\"\n\t\tmeasure: \"A round of tests runs the measure of each constraint and records a pass or a fail, with no manual step.\"\n\t\tserves: [\"autonomy\", \"no_bottleneck\"]\n\t}\n}\n\nintents: {\n\tframe_entry_point: {\n\t\tsays:  \"Make objectives and constraints the single entry point from which the factory works.\"\n\t\tserves: \"autonomy\"\n\t}\n\tany_kind_of_test: {\n\t\tsays:  \"Let a constraint express any kind of test, each one run by a machine.\"\n\t\tserves: \"expressive_tests\"\n\t}\n}\n"
